s enrolled"}, {"pk": 4662, "text": "35 completed the study"}, {"pk": 4663, "text": "A two-period crossover study design"}, {"pk": 4664, "text": "The dose of colesevelam for coadministration with the test drug in each study was 3750 mg (6*625 mg tablets) once daily until the plasma sampling for the test drug was completed"}, {"pk": 4665, "text": "Enalapril 40mg dose alone"}, {"pk": 4666, "text": "Enalapril 40mg plus colesevalam coadministration"}, {"pk": 4667, "text": "Plasma samples for pharmacokinetic analysis were collected just prior to the \ufb01rst dose of medication and up to 144 h post-dose"}, {"pk": 4668, "text": "Plasma samples were analyzed by liquid chromatography\u2013 tandem mass spectrometry (LC\u2013MS/MS"}], "files": [{"pk": 15284, "name": "data/He2014_Fig1.png", "file": "/media/data/He2014_Fig1.png"}, {"pk": 15285, "name": "data/.He2014_Fig1.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.He2014_Fig1.tsv"}, {"pk": 15282, "name": "data/He2014.pdf", "file": "/media/data/He2014.pdf"}, {"pk": 15276, "name": "data/He2014_SupplTab1.png", "file": "/media/data/He2014_SupplTab1.png"}, {"pk": 15287, "name": "data/He2014_Tab1.png", "file": "/media/data/He2014_Tab1.png"}, {"pk": 15279, "name": "data/He2014_Tab2.png", "file": "/media/data/He2014_Tab2.png"}, {"pk": 15281, "name": "data/.He2014_Tab2.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.He2014_Tab2.tsv"}, {"pk": 15286, "name": "data/He2014_Tab3.png", "file": "/media/data/He2014_Tab3.png"}, {"pk": 15277, "name": "data/.He2014_Tab3.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.He2014_Tab3.tsv"}, {"pk": 15288, "name": "data/He2014_Tab4.png", "file": "/media/data/He2014_Tab4.png"}, {"pk": 15280, "name": "data/.He2014_TabGroups.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.He2014_TabGroups.tsv"}, {"pk": 15278, "name": "data/.He2014_TabInterventions.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.He2014_TabInterventions.tsv"}, {"pk": 15283, "name": "data/He2014.xlsx", "file": "/media/data/He2014.xlsx"}], "substances": [{"sid": "enalapril-maleate", "name": "enalapril maleate", "label": "enalapril maleate"